WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.485
Week 15: Health, Body, and Emergencies. describe symptoms understand basic medical questions request urgent help

2
00:00:08.485 --> 00:00:31.847
Read for the situation. Durante una caminata, Luis se cae y se lastima el brazo. Su amiga llama a emergencias, describe el lugar y explica que él está consciente pero tiene mucho dolor. During a hike, Luis falls and hurts his arm. His friend calls emergency services, describes the location, and explains that he is conscious but in a great deal of pain.

3
00:00:31.847 --> 00:00:40.609
Read again for evidence. Identify who acts, what changes, when it happens, and which words establish the relationship between events.

4
00:00:40.609 --> 00:00:46.533
Reading activities. Reading activity 35; Reading activity 36

5
00:00:46.533 --> 00:00:54.527
Retell. Without looking back, give the main idea, three supporting details, and one reasonable inference in Spanish.

6
00:00:54.527 --> 00:01:19.399
Model language. Durante una caminata, Luis se cae. — During a hike, Luis falls. Se lastima el brazo. — He hurts his arm. Su amiga llama a emergencias. — His friend calls emergency services. Describe el lugar con claridad. — She describes the location clearly. Explica que él está consciente. — She explains that he is conscious.

7
00:01:19.399 --> 00:01:29.553
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
